[2026-05-31T15:34:04.123181] [INFO] Node Code Reviewer - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Code Reviewer Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'evaluate.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 40, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 40, 'total_lines': 832, 'snippet': '"""\r\r\nModule containing functions for evaluating the model.\r\r\n"""\r\r\n\r\r\ndef evaluate_model(model, data_loader):\r\r\n    model.eval()\r\r\n    correct = 0\r\r\n    total = 0\r\r\n    with torch.no_grad():\r\r\n        for inputs, labels in data_loader:\r\r\n            outputs = model(inputs)\r\r\n            _, predicted = torch.max(outputs.data, 1)\r\r\n            total += labels.size(0)\r\r\n            correct += (predicted == labels).sum().item()\r\r\n    accuracy = correct / total\r\r\n    return accuracy  # Return accuracy instead of just printing it\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 2609, 'modified_ts': 1780234409.008965, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 874, 'arguments': {'path': 'evaluate.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.0020155906677246094
