[2026-05-31T15:34:04.138010] [INFO] Node Code Reviewer - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Code Reviewer Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'main.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 40, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 40, 'total_lines': 42, 'snippet': '"""\r\r\n\r\r\nThis is the main module to launch the program\r\r\nif __name__ == "__main__":\r\r\n    model = TextCNN(embed_size=300, num_classes=2)  # Instantiate the model here\r\r\n    train_model(model)  # Pass the model to the train_model function\r\r\n    evaluate_model(...)  # Provide the necessary parameters for evaluation\r\r\nfrom evaluate import evaluate_model  # Import the evaluate_model function\r\r\n\r\r\nfrom train import train_model\r\r\n\r\r\n    model = TextCNN(embed_size=300, num_classes=2)  # Adjust embed_size and num_classes as needed\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\nif __name__ == "__main__":\r\r\n\r\r\n    train_model()\r\r\n\r\r\n    evaluate_model()\r\r\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 624, 'modified_ts': 1780234434.3214533, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 942, 'arguments': {'path': 'main.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.013829946517944336
