[2026-05-31T15:34:04.152720] [INFO] Node Code Reviewer - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Code Reviewer Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'model.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 40, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 40, 'total_lines': 1028, 'snippet': '"""\r\r\n\r\r\nModule defining the TextCNN model.\r\r\n\r\r\n"""\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\nimport torch.nn as nn\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\nclass TextCNN(nn.Module):\r\r\n\r\r\n    def __init__(self, embed_size=300, num_classes=2):  # Set default values for embed_size and num_classes\r\r\n\r\r\n        super(TextCNN, self).__init__()\r\r\n\r\r\n        self.embedding = nn.EmbeddingBag(10000, embed_size, sparse=True)\r\r\n\r\r\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 3654, 'modified_ts': 1780234434.3245525, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 692, 'arguments': {'path': 'model.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.012730836868286133
