[2026-05-31T15:34:04.154721] [INFO] Node Code Reviewer - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Code Reviewer Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'train.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 40, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 40, 'total_lines': 374, 'snippet': '"""\r\r\nModule containing functions for training the model.\r\r\n"""\r\r\n\r\r\ndef train_model(model, train_loader, criterion, optimizer, num_epochs=5):\r\r\n    """Train the TextCNN model."""\r\r\n    model.train()\r\r\n    for epoch in range(num_epochs):\r\r\n        for inputs, labels in train_loader:  # Iterate over batches\r\r\n            optimizer.zero_grad()\r\r\n            outputs = model(inputs)\r\r\n            loss = criterion(outputs, labels)\r\r\n            loss.backward()\r\r\n            optimizer.step()\r\r\n            print(f\'Epoch [{epoch+1}/{num_epochs}], Loss: {loss.item():.4f}\')\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\nfrom data_preprocessing import load_data, preprocess_data, split_data\r\r\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 1819, 'modified_ts': 1780234409.0119634, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 986, 'arguments': {'path': 'train.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.002000570297241211
