er: DataLoader for the training dataset.\\r\\r\\n        criterion: Loss function.\\r\\r\\n        optimizer: Optimizer for updating model parameters.\\r\\r\\n        num_epochs: Number of epochs for training.\\r\\r\\n    \\"\\"\\"\\r\\r\\n    model.train()  # Set the model to training mode\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n",\n  "truncated": true,\n  "file_size": 4338,\n  "modified_ts": 1780234530.5114272,\n  "mode": "line_range"\n}', 'tool_call_id': 'call_NlWIgMacgObQ2iNDIAhaAK98', 'metadata': {'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'source': 'Code Reviewer'}}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '{\n  "path": "utils.py",\n  "encoding": "utf-8-sig",\n  "newline": "\\r\\n",\n  "start_line": 1,\n  "end_line": 40,\n  "line_count": 40,\n  "lines_returned": 40,\n  "total_lines": 126,\n  "snippet": "\\"\\"\\"\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\nUtility functions for saving and loading models.\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n\\"\\"\\"\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n    \\"\\"\\"Load the model from the specified path.\\"\\"\\"\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n    model.load_state_dict(torch.load(path))\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\ndef save_model(model, path=\'model.pth\'):\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n    \\"\\"\\"Save the model to the specified path.\\"\\"\\"\\r\\r\\n",\n  "truncated": true,\n  "file_size": 689,\n  "modified_ts": 1780234461.710132,\n  "mode": "line_range"\n}', 'tool_call_id': 'call_mXO9DGjNHbOtKtsBqu5W3r85', 'metadata': {'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'source': 'Code Reviewer'}}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': "### Priority Comment\nThe code snippets across the various modules lack crucial method implementations and logical coherence in the overall workflow, particularly in data loading, training, and evaluation processes. The main module (`main.py`) outlines a structure but does not provide the necessary parameters and logic for data handling, model training, and evaluation, which are critical for the TextCNN model to function properly.\n\n### Suggestions for Revision\n1. **Im