curacy of the model on the test set.\n\n## Conclusion\nThe TextCNN model provides an efficient way to perform text classification tasks. By following the installation and usage instructions in this manual, you can quickly set up the environment and start using the TextCNN model for your own projects.\n", 'encoding': 'utf-8', 'mode': 'overwrite'}, 'stage': 'before'} 
